                    {
                        "sense_id": "d1d85feb-dbae-3606-b394-1fe1af8e8d8a",
                        "entry_id": "11f1b3e9-bd7b-358d-b10e-417c45af08e7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Celui qui fait le stoppage."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3a4ef786-cf21-3da4-97e7-da6d48b36586",
                        "entry_id": "11f1b3e9-bd7b-358d-b10e-417c45af08e7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Lanceur de relève qui entre en jeu en fin de match pour maintenir l’avantage de son équipe."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "319121e0-f1df-4253-b15d-c8606b63c516",
                                "sense_id": "3a4ef786-cf21-3da4-97e7-da6d48b36586",
                                "text": "Les Astros ont offert un contrat d'un an, d'une valeur de 8 millions au joueur d'arrêt-court Carlos Correa et un contrat de 10 millions au stoppeur Roberto Osuna."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "361c3fa5-63f8-318e-b8c1-2f9ce781257f",
                        "entry_id": "11f1b3e9-bd7b-358d-b10e-417c45af08e7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Machine possédant une mâchoire destinée à bloquer les câble-chaîne, on dit aussi stopper."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f249af5-d368-4b25-b51f-68b783c41cb4",
                                "sense_id": "361c3fa5-63f8-318e-b8c1-2f9ce781257f",
                                "text": "En outre , un stoppeur de chaîne ou une saisine de câble devrait être installé entre le guindeau et l'écubier ou dispositif semblable pour chaque chaîne d'ancre ou câble d'ancre , qui puisse retenir le navire à l'ancre."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1c8ee01f-1c2c-33a4-90e3-e56eda5266c6",
                        "entry_id": "11f1b3e9-bd7b-358d-b10e-417c45af08e7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Autostoppeur"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "977f4568-a3cf-4136-a139-6275cfe841e2",
                                "sense_id": "1c8ee01f-1c2c-33a4-90e3-e56eda5266c6",
                                "text": "Au pied d'une grille, un stoppeur. Jamais il ne prend de stoppeur. Trop risqué, contraignant ou ennuyeux. Mais aujourd'hui, il a envie de faire une bonne action."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7b7d11e0-070c-4066-9cc2-438706243c43",
                        "source_entry_id": "11f1b3e9-bd7b-358d-b10e-417c45af08e7",
                        "source_sense_id": "d1d85feb-dbae-3606-b394-1fe1af8e8d8a",
                        "source_sense_description": "Celui qui fait le stoppage",
                        "target_lang_word": "stopper",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "stopper",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d9566abe-8b3e-36b1-a758-1c51252a71ef",
                                        "entry_id": "02532cb4-0b8e-3ffc-82d5-bc410511e981",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone or something that stops something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71a39ddb-a278-4c34-a28b-84db036976e8",
                                                "sense_id": "d9566abe-8b3e-36b1-a758-1c51252a71ef",
                                                "text": "“It just shows you what women are like. A frightful sex, Bertie. There ought to be a law. I hope to live to see the day when women are no longer allowed.” “That would rather put a stopper on keeping the human race going, wouldn't it?” “Well, who wants to keep the human race going?”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3bbc677-e807-4e4e-b257-aac9cb528338",
                                                "sense_id": "d9566abe-8b3e-36b1-a758-1c51252a71ef",
                                                "text": "Often, in our conversations we encourage people to talk, or we manage to stop them. This can happen without our even thinking about it. Following is a list of conversation starters and stoppers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d79ebcfb-03f7-3168-89a9-d9700867a9e2",
                                        "entry_id": "02532cb4-0b8e-3ffc-82d5-bc410511e981",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of knot at the end of a rope, to prevent it from unravelling."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0845ba99-1efe-4687-ae9e-ac87df5e354d",
                                                "sense_id": "d79ebcfb-03f7-3168-89a9-d9700867a9e2",
                                                "text": "Put a stopper in the knot."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2053aaa6-8551-3988-b3f5-6baf5d97bdfb",
                                        "entry_id": "02532cb4-0b8e-3ffc-82d5-bc410511e981",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bung or cork."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3705f69d-2876-4d30-815d-adea57e8625c",
                                                "sense_id": "2053aaa6-8551-3988-b3f5-6baf5d97bdfb",
                                                "text": "We need a stopper or the boat will sink."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f08cfd9-f17d-35d2-b3ec-84773c48d99e",
                                        "entry_id": "02532cb4-0b8e-3ffc-82d5-bc410511e981",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Goalkeeper."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00477f9a-7917-4d70-b837-b39ae3a0de10",
                                                "sense_id": "0f08cfd9-f17d-35d2-b3ec-84773c48d99e",
                                                "text": "He's the number one stopper in the country."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3cec88b-cd11-4cf9-aef6-407ec4c6a6f9",
                                                "sense_id": "0f08cfd9-f17d-35d2-b3ec-84773c48d99e",
                                                "text": "And just before the interval, Kolarov, who was having one of his better games in a City shirt, fizzed in a cracker from 30 yards which the Wolves stopper unconvincingly pushed behind for a corner."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6fe628ab-a032-3680-8367-895cee0c196e",
                                        "entry_id": "02532cb4-0b8e-3ffc-82d5-bc410511e981",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In the commodity futures market, someone who is long (owns) a futures contract and is demanding delivery because they want to take possession of the deliverable commodity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd7e612c-1fc4-4ed5-b3f7-73e353903b0c",
                                                "sense_id": "6fe628ab-a032-3680-8367-895cee0c196e",
                                                "text": "Cattle futures: spillover momentum plus evidence of a strong stopper (i.e., 96 loads demanded) should kick the opening higher."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b674d581-d689-3a40-8685-e36ae44c40e5",
                                        "entry_id": "02532cb4-0b8e-3ffc-82d5-bc410511e981",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A train that calls at all or almost all stations between its origin and destination, including very small ones."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31525d6e-3849-4043-891d-b384b855883d",
                                                "sense_id": "b674d581-d689-3a40-8685-e36ae44c40e5",
                                                "text": "The local train was empty at midday. She changed at Yatton and caught a stopper into Bristol. There was an express calling at Exeter which left Bristol at twelve-forty-five and she caught it by the skin of her teeth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a5fcf86-c22b-49ee-9a50-71d51f8aa720",
                                                "sense_id": "b674d581-d689-3a40-8685-e36ae44c40e5",
                                                "text": "Changing times at Barnham on December 8 2022. Southern 313211 is an all-stations stopper."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd2b9a29-7e00-323c-b366-d2421fb19cb3",
                                        "entry_id": "02532cb4-0b8e-3ffc-82d5-bc410511e981",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of several trees of the genus Eugenia, found in Florida and the West Indies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f61205de-025f-4f57-ae78-6a79a966008a",
                                                "sense_id": "cd2b9a29-7e00-323c-b366-d2421fb19cb3",
                                                "text": "Red Stopper. Leaves ovate-oblong, contracted at the apex into long points, coriaceous. Eugenia Garber"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "49f70369-fd57-3339-9492-68caca2efa66",
                                        "entry_id": "02532cb4-0b8e-3ffc-82d5-bc410511e981",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A short rope for making something fast."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "132328ca-f61f-3f06-bb27-c2f43d43c5bc",
                                        "entry_id": "02532cb4-0b8e-3ffc-82d5-bc410511e981",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A playspot where water flows back on itself, creating a retentive feature."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "stopper",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cbf87ac8-06aa-3203-8c74-3b8e6405b42f",
                                        "entry_id": "1d88929b-28de-3cc1-9275-ad372dd5c80a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To close a container by using a stopper."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "057c4cec-695b-488c-a511-9ef665092561",
                                                "sense_id": "cbf87ac8-06aa-3203-8c74-3b8e6405b42f",
                                                "text": "He tightly stoppered the decanter, thinking the expensive liqueur had been evaporating."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93d0947e-c0da-4561-874b-0cb6f8b3f156",
                                                "sense_id": "cbf87ac8-06aa-3203-8c74-3b8e6405b42f",
                                                "text": "The diaphragmatic spasm of his hiccup caused his epiglottis to painfully stopper his windpipe with a loud \"hic\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
